		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_PHANTA_SUN_CE_TIGER_RETINUE_CAVALRY_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Chinese unique unit when Sun Ce is their leader. Powerful cavalry unit with 10 turns of [ICON_Lifespan] Lifespan, and cannot be upgraded or promoted. Has base [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength equal to the strongest unit your cities have produced. Can move after attacking. +5 [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength when attacking, and deals full damage to the city's walls.</Text>
		</Replace>

		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_PHANTA_SUN_CE_TIGER_RETINUE_WARSHIP_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
			<Text>Chinese unique unit when Sun Ce is their leader. Powerful naval melee unit with 10 turns of [ICON_Lifespan] Lifespan, and cannot be upgraded or promoted. Has base [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength equal to the strongest unit your cities have produced. Can move after attacking. +5 [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength when attacking, and deals full damage to the city's walls.</Text>
		</Replace>

		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_PHANTA_SUN_CE_TIGER_RETINUE_CAVALRY_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>孫策作為領袖時的中國特色單位。擁有10回合 [ICON_Lifespan] 壽命的強力騎兵單位，無法升級或強化。其基礎 [ICON_Strength] 戰鬥力等於城市曾生産之最強單位的戰鬥力。攻擊後可以移動。攻擊時+5 [ICON_Strength] 戰鬥力，並對城牆造成全額傷害。</Text>
		</Replace>

		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_PHANTA_SUN_CE_TIGER_RETINUE_WARSHIP_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>孫策作為領袖時的中國特色單位。擁有10回合 [ICON_Lifespan] 壽命的強力海軍近戰單位，無法升級或強化。其基礎 [ICON_Strength] 戰鬥力等於城市曾生産之最強單位的戰鬥力。攻擊後可以移動。攻擊時+5 [ICON_Strength] 戰鬥力，並對城牆造成全額傷害。</Text>
		</Replace>


		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_PHANTA_SUN_CE_TIGER_RETINUE_CAVALRY_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>孙策作为领袖时的中国特色单位。拥有10回合 [ICON_Lifespan] 寿命的强力骑兵单位，无法升级或强化。其基础 [ICON_Strength] 战斗力等于城市曾生産之最强单位的战斗力。攻击后可以移动。攻击时+5 [ICON_Strength] 战斗力，并对城牆造成全额伤害。</Text>
		</Replace>

		<Replace Tag="LOC_UNIT_PHANTA_SUN_CE_TIGER_RETINUE_WARSHIP_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>孙策作为领袖时的中国特色单位。拥有10回合 [ICON_Lifespan] 寿命的强力海军近战单位，无法升级或强化。其基础 [ICON_Strength] 战斗力等于城市曾生産之最强单位的战斗力。攻击后可以移动。攻击时+5 [ICON_Strength] 战斗力，并对城牆造成全额伤害。</Text>
		</Replace>
		
		
		
		
